w neural strategies shape smooth, accurate, and powerful movement.", "children": [{"id": "8ba4a346-dd11-4b99-82a4-a8da0a59fc72", "type": "concept", "title": "Force gradation"}, {"id": "d58183b7-8126-47cd-ade1-75dbe61a44e6", "type": "concept", "title": "Coactivation"}, {"id": "b8daff5f-d45b-436f-b24d-9530b2821325", "type": "concept", "title": "Synergies"}, {"id": "5c00d252-c570-4d88-b04b-f4d9da8e4724", "type": "concept", "title": "Tremor and variability"}]}, {"id": "efa795b5-8c94-48e1-93df-ab0982130f70", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Fatigue and adaptation", "description": "Students link neuromuscular physiology to performance and clinical limitations.", "children": [{"id": "62e65959-3957-4a37-b5aa-7667848a6d93", "type": "concept", "title": "Central fatigue"}, {"id": "b4fca046-e5ed-4232-9862-6665e24f47b7", "type": "concept", "title": "Peripheral fatigue"}, {"id": "48a89668-469c-4a6e-99b9-f5edc1ae80e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Motor unit firing changes"}, {"id": "7720addb-cefd-4e8b-9cd0-ff58a91dd920", "type": "concept", "title": "Training adaptations"}]}]}, {"id": "b69d9e20-6a62-4df1-9c62-bef56f86750b", "type": "topic", "title": "Spinal Reflexes, Central Pattern Generators, and Locomotion", "description": "Show how spinal circuits generate fast responses and rhythmic movement patterns.", "children": [{"id": "5ed90872-81c9-4e66-a8e0-f1e285729453", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Reflex circuits", "description": "Students learn why fast automatic responses matter for safety, posture, and coordination.", "children": [{"id": "193f1507-061a-48be-83f7-56d782c7b574", "type": "concept", "title": "Stretch reflex"}, {"id": "ad79ff34-67e7-401e-8da0-daaf886b25aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Golgi tendon reflex"}, {"id": "ffb193f7-d73b-4c52-85b3-cd0549d7338e", "type": "concept", "title": "Withdrawal reflex"}, {"id": "6b2a8200-93c7-47bb-a708-21c2315b7fee", "type": "concept", "title": "Reciprocal inhibition"}]}, {"id": "0626d600-4c70-4601-9159-0a4bbcf75bd6", "type": "subtopic",